d 10 items. Tested sorting by \\\"Price: Low to High\\\" - products correctly sorted $35-$320. Upcycled filter shows only 5 upcycled items. All active filters correctly applied to results.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Searched for \\\"headphones\\\" - immediately filtered to 1 result (Sony Noise-Canceling Headphones). Cleared search - results restored to full 10 items. Search updates results in real-time without requiring separate submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added two items to cart: Kids Wooden Train Set ($35) and Complete Harry Potter Book Set ($95). Cart displays both items with titles and prices. Cart total correctly calculated as $130.00. Cart count in header updated immediately from 0→1→2. Each item retained only once.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No visible confirmation message for purchase request submission\", \"actual\": \"Clicked \\\\\\\"Send Purchase Request\\\\\\\" button from cart with 2 items. Cart was cleared without showing any confirmation message. Requirement states \\\\\\\"receives visible confirmation that it was submitted\\\\\\\" - no such confirmation was visible. Also unclear if message dialog was required (requirement says non-empty purchase-request message).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category filter not applied from category page\", \"actual\": \"Clicked Furniture category on categories page. URL changed to ?category=furniture but browse results still show 10 items (all categories) instead of 3 Furniture items. No category filter appears active.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Seller cannot view purchase requests\", \"actual\": \"Logged in as seller (Marcus Chen) and viewed owned product (prod-6: Complete Harry Potter Book Set). No purchase request information or messages section visible on the product detail page or in my-listings. No way found to view buyer messages or purchase requests from seller perspective.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted login with non-existent email (nonexistent@example.com). Login was rejected - remained on login page without creating session.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted registration with existing email (emma@example.com). Registration rejected - form remained on register page without creating new account.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Incorrect password accepted\", \"actual\": \"Login with emma@example.com and incorrect password 'wrongpassword' was accepted. User is now authenticated (Sell and Cart buttons visible in header).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Only \\\\\\\"Add to Cart\\\\\\\" and \\\\\\\"Message Seller\\\\\\\" actions visible for products viewed by non-owner. Edit/Delete actions not shown on product detail page for buyer viewing seller's listing. Seller-management actions appear restricted to owned listings only.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Listing created without required fields - no validation\", \"actual\": \"Created listing with title, description, price, category, condition, and location, but WITHOUT photos. Listing was accepted and saved. Requirement specifies listing cannot be created without \\\\\\\"at least one photo, a title, description, valid price, category, condition, and location\\\\\\\" - photo validation did not work.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created listing with price value \\\\\\\"150\\\\\\\" (non-negative finite number). Listing was accepted. Negative or non-numeric price validation not directly tested, but price input field appears to support numeric entry. Finite number requirement likely supported by input type.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create listing page appears to require authentication (empty semantic snapshot when accessed without login). Add to cart available only when logged in (tested earlier - no \\\\\\\"Add to Cart\\\\\\\" button visible on product pages when not authenticated). Cart page requires authentication to access.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No visible feedback for duplicate email during registration\", \"actual\": \"Attempted registration with existing email (emma@example.com). Form submission was rejected (remained on register page), but no error message was displayed to the user. Requirement specifies \\\\\\\"immediate, visible duplicate-account feedback\\\\\\\" - this feedback was not visible.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested search for \\\\\\\"headphones\\\\\\\" - results immediately updated to 1 matching item without requiring separate submission. Cleared search - results immediately restored to full 10 items. Search updates results dynamically as user types or clears query.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested applying Electronics category filter - results immediately updated from 10 to 1 item. Applied Like New condition filter - results remained at 1 item matching both filters. Cleared all filters - results restored to 10 items. All filter changes immediately updated displayed listings and result count without manual reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added Kids Wooden Train Set ($